    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional 5 Bedroom Detached Home Over 3 Levels Moyglare Hall, Maynooth, Co. Kildare\nA beautifully maintained family home enjoying a superb position overlooking a large green in the highly sought-after Moyglare Hall development.\n\n\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire this superb 5-bedroom detached residence located in the prestigious Moyglare Hall development, Maynooth. This wonderful family home is presented in excellent condition throughout and has been lovingly maintained by the current owners, offering spacious and versatile accommodation arranged over three levels.\n\nApproached by a cobble lock driveway with two side gates, the property boasts a beautifully landscaped and wonderfully private rear garden featuring mature trees, shrubs, a generous decking area and two sheds — providing a perfect outdoor space for entertaining, relaxing and family enjoyment.\n\nInternally, the property offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation with a welcoming entrance hall, elegant living room, large kitchen/dining area and separate sitting room. The upper floors provide four well-appointed bedrooms including one with ensuite, a family bathroom, and a superb master suite located on the second floor with ensuite facilities.\n\nMoyglare Hall is renowned as one of Maynooth's most desirable residential developments, with homes built to a very high standard and offering a peaceful, mature setting. The development benefits from attractive green areas, quality landscaping and a strong sense of community.\n\nAccommodation comprises:\n\nGround Floor\n\nEntrance Hall\nBright and welcoming entrance area.\nLiving Room: 6.0m x 3.8m\nA spacious and comfortable reception room.\nKitchen / Dining Room: 5.8m x 7.0m\nA generous open-plan style family space ideal for modern living and entertaining.\nSitting Room: 4.1m x 3.0m\nAdditional reception room with excellent flexibility.\n\nFirst Floor\nBedroom 1: 4.4m x 3.5m\nEnsuite: 2.3m x 1.1m\nBedroom 2: 3.1m x 3.0m\nFamily Bathroom: 1.9m x 1.7m\nBedroom 3: 3.0m x 2.7m\nBedroom 4: 3.1m x 2.6m\n\nSecond Floor\nMaster Suite: 6.1m x 2.6m\nA wonderful private bedroom suite.\nEnsuite: 1.6m x 2.3m\n\nOutside:\n•Cobble lock driveway \n•Two side access gates \n•Private landscaped rear garden \n•Mature trees and shrubs \n•Decking area \n•Two sheds \n\nLocation\nMoyglare Hall enjoys an enviable location in Maynooth, one of Kildare's most sought-after towns. The property is within easy reach of a host of excellent amenities including Maynooth University, schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, sports and leisure facilities. Maynooth train station and excellent transport links provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre, while the M4 motorway offers easy connectivity to surrounding areas.\n\nThis exceptional home combines generous accommodation, excellent presentation and a superb location — making it an ideal choice for families seeking a quality home in a highly desirable Maynooth setting.\n\nViewing is highly recommended through the sole selling agents LIAM REILLY AUCTIONEERS.\n\n\nLIAM REILLY AUCTIONEERS give notice that all descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them.\n\n\n"
